From: Etna Workload <noreply@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] userinfo_missing_at_749eda6 — serializeUserInfo dropped trailing '@'

Hand-crafted re-injection of the bug fixed by upstream commit
749eda6df2d4e8647f556c51e5e3bf55e12e1fdf ("Fix serialization bug with
userinfo"). Forward-applying this patch leaves base unchanged; reversing
it removes the trailing '@' character from the serialized userinfo,
restoring the original bug.

---
 src/URI/ByteString/Internal.hs | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/URI/ByteString/Internal.hs b/src/URI/ByteString/Internal.hs
--- a/src/URI/ByteString/Internal.hs
+++ b/src/URI/ByteString/Internal.hs
@@ -335,7 +335,7 @@

 -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 serializeUserInfo :: UserInfo -> Builder
-serializeUserInfo UserInfo {..} = bs uiUsername <> c8 ':' <> bs uiPassword
+serializeUserInfo UserInfo {..} = bs uiUsername <> c8 ':' <> bs uiPassword <> c8 '@'

 serializeUserInfo' :: UserInfo -> ByteString
 serializeUserInfo' = BB.toByteString . serializeUserInfo
